  "notes": "Offline reviewed and tested. Fixes the stale 230.84 direct identity reply that prevented 230.86 capability negotiation. Retains the keyboard relay and default-off Guardian per-lens peer-MAC diagnostics to the exact 230.84 parent. Diagnostics require explicit SybilSight Guardian opt-in and a renewable 30-second lease; connected phone device names are unavailable. Eleven emitted-code, ABI, sanitizer and malformed-input checks pass; the 97-operation stock recipe reproduces this bundle exactly. Hardware pairing, key delivery and simultaneous microphone/display operation have not yet been validated for 230.87.",
  "capabilities": [
    "Default-off Guardian peer-MAC diagnostics: LEFT upper and RIGHT lower dashboard lanes, enabled only by explicit app troubleshooting opt-in",
    "BLE keyboard pairing and key-report relay through G2: keyboard contract v1 restored from pinned upstream revision 39",
    "Preserves the revision-84 dual-link stereo microphone relay, nonce-clock GX8002 codec and PDM probe hooks",
    "Retained display, compressed image transports, texture cache and atomic drawing on the revision-35 display ABI",
    "Direct per-lens nonce-bound FI/v1 identity requires SybilSight/230.87 on both temples",
    "Only the Apollo main changes from 230.84; all five non-main components remain byte-identical to the parent"
  ],
